<title>LATVIA: Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian Treasury bills for all maturities except three-month paper fell at the weekly auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY     AVG YLD (PVT)    AVG LAST WEEK   ISSUE   BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month    10.05</p>
</text>
